      "username": "NCP",
      "name": "Nihantra Patel",
      "created_at": "2023-10-01T09:26:02.654Z",
      "cooked": "<p><code>frappe.render_template()</code> is a function used for rendering HTML templates in your custom applications or scripts. It allows you to generate HTML content dynamically by merging data with an HTML template. This function is often used in the context of web routing to display dynamic web pages.</p>",
